00:03:26.773 --> 00:03:33.480 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 "Sept garçons", dit-il.

00:03:29.776 --> 00:03:35.515 size:53% position:73% line:68%
Puis, il se ravise, il a aus

00:03:31.778 --> 00:03:37.651 size:53% position:73% line:68%
trois filles.

00:03:33.814 --> 00:03:39.653 size:53% position:73% line:68%
 "Trois d'entre eux

00:03:35.849 --> 00:03:41.688 size:53% position:73% line:68%
sont des filles, d

00:03:37.984 --> 00:03:43.723 size:53% position:73% line:68%
et sept garçons. C'est

00:03:39.986 --> 00:03:45.725 size:53% position:73% line:68%
